---
/**
 * pages/[...slug].astro
 *
 * Catch-all route for the CMS-authored public pages, stored in EmDash (the `pages` content type). The
 * page is now **prerendered**: getStaticPaths() enumerates the published pages at build time by fetching
 * EmDash's HTTP API (src/lib/build/emdash-api.ts, through a Cloudflare Access service token), and each
 * page's rich-text body is rendered through EmDash's PortableText component in the PublicPage layout.
 *
 * Because only published slugs are built, an unknown path matches no route and is served the static 404
 * from the Cloudflare ASSETS binding — with no D1 or KV lookup. Publishing or editing a page requires a
 * site rebuild (the admin Rebuild button) to regenerate these static pages.
 *
 * As a rest-parameter route this has the lowest routing priority, so explicit files (index.astro,
 * privacy-policy.astro, the /admin and /api trees) always win.
 *
